    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Winter Vacation)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "During winter vacation, we don’t travel very often."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "However, last year we went on a short skiing trip"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "to KangWon Province."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My mother wants me to study more,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "so every day during winter break, she makes me study."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Because I like to read by myself, I usually read a lot during vacation."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I like vacations because I have more freedom to do what I want."
    },
